abstract: >-
  Manuscript, multimedia appendices, committed results files and the scripts that build every table and figure for a
  preregistered retrospective cohort study of Medicare Shared Savings Program accountable care organizations that
  renewed their agreements early in 2022. The registered analysis plan and code are archived on OSF Registries
  (doi:10.17605/OSF.IO/C53W9); the data snapshot and results notebook are in the OSF project
  (doi:10.17605/OSF.IO/Z4AN5).
keywords:
  - accountable care organizations
  - Medicare Shared Savings Program
  - benchmarks
  - alternative payment models
  - preregistration
  - difference-in-differences
  - Bayesian analysis
